7b5df815bba905e6ce5c03fd076.webm?t=1665043860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681850/extras/2b5027b5df815bba905e6ce5c03fd076.mp4?t=1665043860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANDBOX</h2>Become a true god of chaos and play with the infinite possibilities of sandbox mode! Every unit type, contraption, enemy, beast, weapon and building block is unlocked and at your fingertips! Want to give that dinosaur a shotgun? Go for it! Those tiny arms can handle it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681850/extras/da350ad649877a49ba831c1bfdb9ed9b.poster.avif?t=1665043860\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681850/extras/da350ad649877a49ba831c1bfdb9ed9b.webm?t=1665043860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681850/extras/da350ad649877a49ba831c1bfdb9ed9b.mp4?t=1665043860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
